### Register a new Admin User
POST https://localhost:7243/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!",
  "role": "Admin"
}

###

### Register a new Regular User
POST https://localhost:7243/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user",
  "password": "User123!",
  "role": "User"
}

###

### Login as Admin and get JWT Token
POST https://localhost:7243/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

###

### Login as User and get JWT Token
POST https://localhost:7243/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user",
  "password": "User123!"
}

###

### Get all employees (Admin or User role required)
GET https://localhost:7243/api/employee
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### Get employee by ID (Admin or User role required)
GET https://localhost:7243/api/employee/1
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

###

### Create new employee (Admin role required)
POST https://localhost:7243/api/employee
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "123-456-7890",
  "department": "IT",
  "position": "Software Developer",
  "salary": 75000,
  "hireDate": "2023-01-15"
}

###

### Update employee (Admin role required)
PUT https://localhost:7243/api/employee/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "email": "john.smith@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "123-456-7890",
  "department": "IT",
  "position": "Senior Software Developer",
  "salary": 85000,
  "hireDate": "2023-01-15"
}

###

### Delete employee (Admin role required)
DELETE https://localhost:7243/api/employee/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### Get high earners (Admin or User role required)
GET https://localhost:7243/api/employee/high-salary?minSalary=70000
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

###

### Get department statistics (Admin role required)
GET https://localhost:7243/api/employee/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}